```

The same file imports `httpClientFactory`, `webauthnAbortService`, `identifyRegistrationError`, and `identifyAuthenticationError`. Confirm the old callers, the actual version, and the entry point before deciding whether to migrate; without those three, don't infer compatibility from the filename. The new entry point and the steps for restoring the old path are still missing.
